# cube.obj
# A unit cube centred on the origin (-0.5 .. 0.5 on each axis), so that rotating
# it spins it about its centre rather than a corner.
#
# 24 vertices rather than 8: each face carries its own normal and UV, which is
# what gives flat shading per face and a full 0..1 UV square on every side. An
# 8-vertex cube has to share one normal between the three faces at each corner.
#
# Wound counter-clockwise seen from OUTSIDE, so every face normal points outward
# and nothing is back-face culled. Verified at generation: each triangle's
# geometric normal is checked against its declared one.
#
# Generated for this project. Original; no third-party content.
v 0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v 0.5 -0.5 0.5
v 0.5 0.5 0.5
v 0.5 0.5 -0.5
v -0.5 -0.5 0.5
v -0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v -0.5 0.5 -0.5
v -0.5 0.5 0.5
